<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>this macro minimizes the recoil on ak12
it wont fully remove the recoil as around the third spray recoil becomes stronger and for that spray the recoil will be slightly above the aimed point

settings:
fov 84
1920x1080
sens 6
dpi 800
2.5 50

ak12 build:
supresor magnified angled grip

if the recoil isnt pulling enough lower delays
if the recoil is pulling too mutch higher the delays
if both of those dont help enough change mouse cords
make sure to change the mouse settings 1x/y at a time</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 6 ms
MoveR 0 17
Delay 7 ms
MoveR -1 17
Delay 6 ms
MoveR 0 18
Delay 6 ms
MoveR -1 17
Delay 7 ms
MoveR 0 17
Delay 6 ms
MoveR -1 17
Delay 6 ms
MoveR 0 18
Delay 6 ms
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>